### `333 logs`: the last lines this node wrote while it ran in the background.

logs-none = nothing yet. Only a node running in the background keeps its lines;
    `333 start` runs it there.
    .keyword = logs

logs-nothing-yet = none kept yet.
    .keyword = logs

logs-cannot-follow = `-f` follows new lines only where systemd keeps them. These are
    the last ones.
    .keyword = logs
